#: app/src/features/settings/SettingsDialog.tsx
msgid "What Owlit calls you, the work it does when nobody is waiting, and what it remembers. Your name is told only to the agent you chat with."
msgstr "What Owlit calls you, the work it does when nobody is waiting, and what it remembers. Your name is told only to the agent you chat with."

#: app/src/features/settings/SettingsDialog.tsx
msgid "Coding agents installed on this computer, driven over the Agent Client Protocol. Each agent uses its own sign-in; owlit stores no keys for them."
msgstr "Coding agents installed on this computer, driven over the Agent Client Protocol. Each agent uses its own sign-in; owlit stores no keys for them."

#: app/src/features/settings/SettingsDialog.tsx
msgid "How owlit finds papers, gets their PDFs and reads their text. Everything here is optional; it makes those work better."
msgstr "How owlit finds papers, gets their PDFs and reads their text. Everything here is optional; it makes those work better."

#: app/src/features/settings/SettingsDialog.tsx
msgid "How owlit looks on this computer. Stars, notes, tags and PDF highlights keep their colours in every tone, because the colour is what they mean."
msgstr "How owlit looks on this computer. Stars, notes, tags and PDF highlights keep their colours in every tone, because the colour is what they mean."

